#
# File: 010-traceroute-udp-dports33434-in-req-accept.rule
# Title: Allow remote traceroute client request to local traceroute server

# Inbound UDP traceroute request
# Called by: zones/red/ip-filter-input-red-udp.chain
udp dport 33434-33534 accept comment "remote-to-local inbound traceroute request"
